      "text": "Annex 3. GRADE summary of evidence tables",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        395.2441101074219,
        209.26722717285156,
        407.8441162109375
      ],
      "text": "TBI does not apply to the general population. a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        407.2441101074219,
        786.8939819335938,
        416.8441162109375
      ],
      "text": "Ascertainment bias highly likely, as TB cases in the general population detected passively, while TB cases in contacts detected actively. As a result, the relative and absolute risks might be overestimated. The composition of the  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        66.61419677734375,
        416.2441101074219,
        389.4540710449219,
        425.8441162109375
      ],
      "text": "general and the study population differed (general population of all ages versus a specific age group).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        422.2441101074219,
        399.33477783203125,
        434.8441162109375
      ],
      "text": "High heterogeneity among studies (I  = 83.9%), probably due to differences in background TB incidence. c \t 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        431.2441101074219,
        513.5579223632812,
        443.8441162109375
      ],
      "text": "Serious imprecision with a wide confidence interval for the effect estimates, probably due to small study size and number of outcome events. d",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        440.2441101074219,
        580.6450805664062,
        452.8441162109375
      ],
      "text": "I  = 72.5%, indicating moderate heterogeneity, probably due to differences in background TB prevalence; however, there is a trend across age groups and studies.  e \t 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        452.2441101074219,
        144.75669860839844,
        461.8441162109375
      ],
      "text": "Few events and wide CI.  f",
